WEBVTT

00:00:12.380 --> 00:00:14.430
<i>GeGeGe no Kitaro</i>

00:00:16.090 --> 00:00:17.350
They're Kinoko.

00:00:17.470 --> 00:00:18.890
Kinoko?

00:00:19.010 --> 00:00:20.220
Then Miyabi is...?

00:00:21.980 --> 00:00:23.100
I like this one!

00:00:24.140 --> 00:00:25.150
Wait!

00:00:30.900 --> 00:00:33.740
<i>The world you see isn't all there is.</i>

00:00:34.400 --> 00:00:36.620
<i>There are things you can't see.</i>

00:00:37.070 --> 00:00:40.410
<i>See? In the darkness behind you...</i>

00:00:56.640 --> 00:01:00.310
<i>Ge, ge, gegege no ge</i>

00:00:56.640 --> 00:01:00.310
<i>ge ge gegege no ge</i>

00:01:00.640 --> 00:01:04.230
<i>Slumbering in bed in the morning</i>

00:01:00.640 --> 00:01:04.230
<i>asa wa nedoko de gu gu gu</i>

00:01:05.060 --> 00:01:08.940
<i>It's so fun, it's so fun</i>

00:01:05.060 --> 00:01:08.940
<i>tanoshiina tanoshiina</i>

00:01:09.060 --> 00:01:12.730
<i>Ghosts don't have school</i>

00:01:09.060 --> 00:01:12.730
<i>obakenya gakkou mo</i>

00:01:12.860 --> 00:01:16.610
<i>Or tests or anything</i>

00:01:12.860 --> 00:01:16.610
<i>shiken mo nannimo nai</i>

00:01:17.200 --> 00:01:21.410
<i>Ge, ge, gegege no ge</i>

00:01:17.200 --> 00:01:21.410
<i>ge ge gegege no ge</i>

00:01:21.540 --> 00:01:25.000
<i>Let's all sing together, gegege no ge</i>

00:01:21.540 --> 00:01:25.000
<i>minna de utaou gegege no ge</i>

00:01:25.330 --> 00:01:29.210
<i>Ge, ge, gegege no ge</i>

00:01:25.330 --> 00:01:29.210
<i>ge ge gegege no ge</i>

00:01:29.630 --> 00:01:33.090
<i>Sports festivals in the graveyard at night</i>

00:01:29.630 --> 00:01:33.090
<i>yoru wa hakaba de undoukai</i>

00:01:33.960 --> 00:01:37.970
<i>It's so fun, it's so fun</i>

00:01:33.960 --> 00:01:37.970
<i>tanoshiina tanoshiina</i>

00:01:38.090 --> 00:01:42.100
<i>Ghosts don't die</i>

00:01:38.090 --> 00:01:42.100
<i>obake wa shinanai</i>

00:01:42.220 --> 00:01:45.520
<i>Or get sick or anything</i>

00:01:42.220 --> 00:01:45.520
<i>byouki mo nannimo nai</i>

00:01:46.390 --> 00:01:49.980
<i>Ge, ge, gegege no ge</i>

00:01:46.390 --> 00:01:49.980
<i>ge ge gegege no ge</i>

00:01:50.360 --> 00:01:54.320
<i>Let's all sing together, gegege no ge</i>

00:01:50.360 --> 00:01:54.320
<i>minnade utaou gegege no ge</i>

00:01:54.440 --> 00:01:58.280
<i>Let's all sing together, gegege no ge</i>

00:01:54.440 --> 00:01:58.280
<i>minnade utaou gegege no ge</i>

00:01:58.780 --> 00:02:03.240
<i>Let's all sing together, gegege no ge</i>

00:01:58.780 --> 00:02:03.240
<i>minnade utaou gegege no ge</i>

00:02:10.380 --> 00:02:13.130
<i>No grownups. No tests or studying.</i>

00:02:13.250 --> 00:02:15.460
<i>No having to help.</i>

00:02:15.590 --> 00:02:19.740
<i>A world I've always
hoped and dreamed of...</i>

00:02:19.760 --> 00:02:22.620
Stay here and play with us.

00:02:22.970 --> 00:02:25.450
You can stay here forever.

00:02:26.180 --> 00:02:28.960
Yeah. I wanna stay here.

00:02:29.270 --> 00:02:33.400
I'll stay here forever and ever!

00:02:33.980 --> 00:02:35.030
CHAPTER 52

00:02:35.530 --> 00:02:39.970
RUNAWAY GIRL! THE FOREST OF THE KINOKO

00:02:43.740 --> 00:02:46.330
Darn it! Can't you wake me up earlier?!

00:02:46.450 --> 00:02:48.460
I called you a dozen times already!

00:02:48.600 --> 00:02:49.160
Oh man!

00:02:49.290 --> 00:02:54.820
You're up late with your smartphone on
Saturday nights, that's why you oversleep!

00:02:51.330 --> 00:02:54.710
<i>"Running late. My mom didn't wake me up!"</i>

00:02:55.500 --> 00:02:57.920
Are the clothes I asked you to wash dry?

00:02:58.050 --> 00:02:59.260
What clothes?

00:02:59.380 --> 00:03:03.430
I told you to wash them
because I was going out with Mana today!

00:03:03.550 --> 00:03:04.580
Ow!

00:03:06.390 --> 00:03:11.730
Honestly, can't you make a more
INSTE-worthy breakfast?

00:03:11.850 --> 00:03:14.440
Then help cook, Miyabi!

00:03:15.270 --> 00:03:18.210
And what's the meaning of this?

00:03:18.740 --> 00:03:20.900
I found these behind your bookshelf.

00:03:21.030 --> 00:03:23.660
Hey! Don't go into my room
without permission!

00:03:23.780 --> 00:03:26.580
It's your fault for not cleaning!

00:03:26.700 --> 00:03:29.000
That's not the point!

00:03:29.120 --> 00:03:32.500
If your grades get any lower,
I'm cancelling your smartphone.

00:03:32.620 --> 00:03:35.340
But I can't live without my smartphone!

00:03:35.460 --> 00:03:39.690
Then get off the internet for once
and study properly.

00:03:42.680 --> 00:03:45.280
Miyabi! Finish your breakfast!

00:03:45.550 --> 00:03:48.040
No way! I don't need that boring meal!

00:03:54.310 --> 00:03:56.380
Just to be sure...

00:03:56.400 --> 00:04:01.630
Kitaro, the Four Treasonous Generals
that you have to capture are,

00:04:01.900 --> 00:04:05.490
aside from the already defeated Nue...

00:04:06.330 --> 00:04:07.510
The Kurobozu.

00:04:08.240 --> 00:04:09.810
KUROBOZU

00:04:09.830 --> 00:04:11.850
The Kido, Ibukimaru.

00:04:12.660 --> 00:04:14.310
KIDO

00:04:14.330 --> 00:04:18.670
And Tamamo-no-Mae,
also known as the Kyubi no Kitsune.

00:04:19.090 --> 00:04:20.650
KYUBI NO KITSUNE

00:04:21.090 --> 00:04:23.820
Those are the four?

00:04:23.840 --> 00:04:24.840
That's right.

00:04:24.970 --> 00:04:27.720
They're all tough ones.

00:04:27.850 --> 00:04:31.060
And, aside from Kitaro...

00:04:31.180 --> 00:04:36.060
That Kidoshu boy, Rei,
is also huntin' them.

00:04:36.440 --> 00:04:40.400
It looks like he defeats <i>yokai</i>,
absorbs their souls,

00:04:40.530 --> 00:04:44.930
and when needed, summons them forth
and allows them to possess him.

00:04:45.320 --> 00:04:51.220
Basically, the more <i>yokai</i> he defeats,
the stronger he becomes.

00:04:51.220 --> 00:04:55.710
Actually, we got word from Kagami-Jijii.

00:04:55.960 --> 00:05:00.800
Remember how he mentioned that
Hitotsumebo was missing?

00:05:01.800 --> 00:05:06.760
Apparently he was hunted down
by that boy Rei.

00:05:07.590 --> 00:05:10.640
Hitotsumebo's eye can see long distances.

00:05:10.760 --> 00:05:14.870
It also can see things through walls.

00:05:16.900 --> 00:05:19.750
The perfect skill for finding <i>yokai</i>.

00:05:20.230 --> 00:05:23.690
He hunted Hitotsumebo down to
use him as a tool?

00:05:24.740 --> 00:05:26.380
Hey, Kitaro!

00:05:26.660 --> 00:05:28.700
I'm sorry, Dad!

00:05:29.530 --> 00:05:32.410
The Treasonous Four Generals
and the Kidoshu...

00:05:32.540 --> 00:05:37.330
Enma-Daio certainly pushed
a tedious task on you.

00:05:37.460 --> 00:05:41.570
It's for Catchick. What choice do we have?

00:05:42.130 --> 00:05:44.130
<i>Rei Isurugi...</i>

00:05:45.170 --> 00:05:49.450
<i>Man, things were better when I was small.</i>

00:05:49.470 --> 00:05:56.000
<i>No one told me to help make meals
or to study.</i>

00:05:56.020 --> 00:06:01.900
<i>I mean, just playing around would get you
complimented for some reason.</i>

00:06:02.860 --> 00:06:07.740
<i>I seriously wish I could go back to then!</i>

00:06:10.030 --> 00:06:11.070
Huh?

00:06:15.250 --> 00:06:17.560
Wait... What is this?!

00:06:18.420 --> 00:06:20.580
Where am I?

00:06:22.880 --> 00:06:25.630
I was just in the convenience store...

00:06:26.800 --> 00:06:28.700
Help me, Mana!

00:06:29.090 --> 00:06:31.350
A new friend?

00:06:32.350 --> 00:06:33.970
Friend?

00:06:34.970 --> 00:06:36.480
You're right!

00:06:38.710 --> 00:06:41.380
Wh-Who are you?

00:06:41.730 --> 00:06:43.520
We're Kinoko!

00:06:43.730 --> 00:06:45.460
KINOKO

00:06:45.480 --> 00:06:47.950
K-Kinoko?

00:06:48.320 --> 00:06:50.990
Say, where are your dads and moms?

00:06:51.110 --> 00:06:52.890
Dads?

00:06:53.160 --> 00:06:54.870
Moms?

00:06:54.990 --> 00:06:57.830
What are dads and moms?

00:06:57.960 --> 00:07:00.080
What?

00:07:00.210 --> 00:07:01.540
What?!

00:07:01.670 --> 00:07:02.840
Seriously?

00:07:02.960 --> 00:07:05.250
<i>What strange kids.</i>

00:07:05.380 --> 00:07:07.740
<i>Are they fairies? Or </i>yokai<i>?</i>

00:07:08.340 --> 00:07:09.720
<i>Yeah. As if.</i>

00:07:09.840 --> 00:07:10.950
Let's go!

00:07:11.800 --> 00:07:13.200
What?!

00:07:13.850 --> 00:07:14.680
This way!

00:07:14.810 --> 00:07:16.770
Hold on!

00:07:17.810 --> 00:07:21.210
What?! Miyabi already left
a long time ago?

00:07:21.560 --> 00:07:24.670
I wonder where she could have gone.

00:07:24.980 --> 00:07:27.320
I see. Excuse me.

00:07:28.320 --> 00:07:32.360
I'll go look for her.
Let me know if you reach her.

00:07:32.490 --> 00:07:33.680
Okay.

00:07:33.700 --> 00:07:35.680
Time for a break!

00:07:35.950 --> 00:07:38.120
A break!

00:07:44.630 --> 00:07:50.130
That's right.
I didn't really eat breakfast.

00:07:52.220 --> 00:07:53.410
Here!

00:07:53.430 --> 00:07:57.080
Huh? Wait, these are mud dumplings, right?

00:08:08.530 --> 00:08:09.820
Yummy!

00:08:10.940 --> 00:08:13.590
The river water tastes like juice!

00:08:13.910 --> 00:08:17.160
I've never had sweets this good before!

00:08:18.240 --> 00:08:19.870
Where are we?

00:08:20.000 --> 00:08:21.790
This is our forest.

00:08:21.910 --> 00:08:23.620
Your forest?

00:08:24.120 --> 00:08:26.540
Do you all live here or something?

00:08:26.670 --> 00:08:27.670
Yeah!

00:08:30.090 --> 00:08:31.920
Don't you have to study?

00:08:32.050 --> 00:08:34.130
What's study?

00:08:34.260 --> 00:08:35.970
Yahoo!

00:08:43.480 --> 00:08:44.810
Don't you have tests?

00:08:44.940 --> 00:08:46.360
What are tests?

00:08:46.480 --> 00:08:48.480
Aren't there any grownups?

00:08:48.610 --> 00:08:50.900
What are grownups?

00:08:53.820 --> 00:08:55.780
What a pretty sunset!

00:08:56.280 --> 00:08:57.570
Here.

00:08:58.370 --> 00:08:59.990
Just like me!

00:09:07.710 --> 00:09:10.340
Oh no, I need to get home!

00:09:10.460 --> 00:09:11.590
Home?

00:09:11.710 --> 00:09:14.220
Your home is here, Miyabi.

00:09:14.880 --> 00:09:17.820
Stay here and play with us.

00:09:18.100 --> 00:09:20.410
You can stay here forever.

00:09:20.430 --> 00:09:22.850
Come on, Miyabi.

00:09:22.980 --> 00:09:24.390
Together forever.

00:09:24.520 --> 00:09:27.310
<i>No grownups. No tests or studying.</i>

00:09:27.440 --> 00:09:29.790
<i>No having to help.</i>

00:09:30.270 --> 00:09:34.030
<i>A world I've always
hoped and dreamed of...</i>

00:09:36.450 --> 00:09:39.580
Yeah. I wanna stay here.

00:09:39.700 --> 00:09:43.140
I'll stay here forever and ever!

00:09:50.670 --> 00:09:52.550
<i>"I gotta cancel on today."</i>

00:09:51.500 --> 00:09:52.650
Miyabi!

00:09:53.090 --> 00:09:56.130
She finally got in touch...

00:09:57.150 --> 00:09:59.260
What is this photo?

00:10:00.220 --> 00:10:02.530
It's certainly a strange photo.

00:10:02.810 --> 00:10:05.290
<i>So you think so, too, right Cat-san?</i>

00:10:09.440 --> 00:10:11.150
Why you! There!

00:10:11.730 --> 00:10:14.070
Miyabi's gonna getcha!

00:10:15.610 --> 00:10:16.510
Ow, ow...

00:10:16.990 --> 00:10:20.510
Huh? I think my shoes have shrunk.

00:10:20.530 --> 00:10:22.510
Then just take them off.

00:10:22.530 --> 00:10:24.490
Just go barefoot!

00:10:24.620 --> 00:10:25.390
True!

00:10:25.750 --> 00:10:27.540
Whee!

00:10:31.630 --> 00:10:35.730
The children she's playing with,
they're Kinoko.

00:10:35.760 --> 00:10:36.920
Kinoko?

00:10:37.050 --> 00:10:41.850
It looks like she's wandered into
the forest where they live.

00:10:41.970 --> 00:10:43.350
Then Miyabi is...?

00:10:43.470 --> 00:10:45.180
There's nothing to fear.

00:10:45.310 --> 00:10:50.650
Kinoko are forest spirits.
They won't harm a human.

00:10:50.770 --> 00:10:52.630
Thank goodness.

00:10:52.650 --> 00:10:53.940
However,

00:10:54.070 --> 00:10:57.820
we should get her back from the forest
as soon as possible.

00:11:01.780 --> 00:11:05.120
Oh, your tummy's showing, Miyabi!

00:11:07.080 --> 00:11:08.790
Don't blame me.

00:11:08.910 --> 00:11:14.090
My body's grown but I've been
wearing the same clothes.

00:11:14.730 --> 00:11:18.300
<i>But, everyone else is still a child.</i>

00:11:18.420 --> 00:11:22.050
<i>I'm the only one that's growing?</i>

00:11:22.180 --> 00:11:24.120
What's wrong, Miyabi?

00:11:24.810 --> 00:11:26.390
It's nothing.

00:11:26.520 --> 00:11:28.750
What should we play today?

00:11:28.770 --> 00:11:30.410
Come on!

00:11:30.440 --> 00:11:31.140
No!

00:11:31.270 --> 00:11:32.020
Ow!

00:11:32.150 --> 00:11:33.190
Sorry!

00:11:33.310 --> 00:11:36.980
I'm fine today.
You all go play without me.

00:11:37.110 --> 00:11:38.420
Aww.

00:11:42.110 --> 00:11:44.450
Why am I...

00:11:59.550 --> 00:12:00.780
How come...

00:12:01.590 --> 00:12:06.200
I never thought their muddy clothes
or room was dirty before.

00:12:08.060 --> 00:12:12.480
I wonder how long it's been
since I came to this forest?

00:12:12.600 --> 00:12:15.560
Long enough that you're no longer a child.

00:12:16.980 --> 00:12:18.440
You...

00:12:21.280 --> 00:12:23.630
KINOKO

00:12:24.530 --> 00:12:28.140
KINOKO

00:12:26.160 --> 00:12:27.030
-<i>"Eek!"</i>
-<i>"What?"</i>

00:12:27.160 --> 00:12:28.040
<i>"Scratch, scratch."</i>

00:12:28.620 --> 00:12:29.580
You...

00:12:29.700 --> 00:12:32.000
I'm GeGeGe no Kitaro.

00:12:32.120 --> 00:12:34.040
This is my dad.

00:12:34.170 --> 00:12:37.500
Mana asked us to come bring you home.

00:12:37.630 --> 00:12:38.520
Mana did?

00:12:38.840 --> 00:12:40.590
Listen carefully.

00:12:40.710 --> 00:12:46.720
Time passes differently in this forest of
the Kinoko and the human world.

00:12:47.050 --> 00:12:49.470
The path that links the two worlds

00:12:49.600 --> 00:12:54.080
opens only briefly every 500 years.

00:12:54.980 --> 00:13:01.150
Spirits and <i>yokai</i> are fine, but,
as a human, unless you return now,

00:13:01.280 --> 00:13:05.490
you'll never be able to return to
the human world.

00:13:06.530 --> 00:13:09.950
Come back to your world with us.

00:13:10.910 --> 00:13:13.160
No! I don't want to go back!

00:13:13.290 --> 00:13:13.890
Huh?

00:13:13.890 --> 00:13:18.130
There's no tests or studying here.

00:13:18.250 --> 00:13:21.030
Nobody nags me about anything.

00:13:21.880 --> 00:13:25.360
I can just play from morning to night.

00:13:25.930 --> 00:13:28.300
I'm staying here forever!

00:13:29.220 --> 00:13:30.760
I've heard of him.

00:13:30.890 --> 00:13:34.520
That Kitaro guy is really strong.

00:13:34.640 --> 00:13:38.880
What do we do? He might take Miyabi away!

00:13:39.520 --> 00:13:41.530
Let's go ask Yama-Tengu-san!

00:13:41.650 --> 00:13:44.900
What?! That's a little scary.

00:13:58.020 --> 00:13:59.710
Hey!

00:14:00.190 --> 00:14:05.150
I just cleaned this room and
now look what you've done to it!

00:14:05.170 --> 00:14:08.470
And your clothes! I just washed them
and now they're filthy!

00:14:08.590 --> 00:14:10.570
No matter how much I wash...

00:14:14.640 --> 00:14:17.040
What's wrong with you, Miyabi?

00:14:19.520 --> 00:14:21.110
We're sorry, Miyabi.

00:14:21.230 --> 00:14:23.280
We're sorry.

00:14:23.400 --> 00:14:26.280
Sorry, Miyabi.

00:14:26.610 --> 00:14:28.410
<i>I get it.</i>

00:14:28.660 --> 00:14:32.990
<i>Mom always had it this hard.</i>

00:14:34.200 --> 00:14:36.830
My battery's dead.

00:14:36.960 --> 00:14:39.210
I wonder how they're doing...

00:14:39.330 --> 00:14:41.920
Dad... Mom...

00:14:42.210 --> 00:14:44.300
Mana... Everyone...

00:14:44.420 --> 00:14:45.710
Miyabi.

00:14:46.400 --> 00:14:49.050
Have some dumplings. Please forgive us.

00:14:49.180 --> 00:14:51.780
Be the Miyabi you always were.

00:14:51.800 --> 00:14:53.390
Thank you.

00:15:02.360 --> 00:15:03.570
<i>Why?</i>

00:15:03.690 --> 00:15:06.210
<i>They always tasted so good.</i>

00:15:06.210 --> 00:15:10.220
<i>Now all I can taste is mud!</i>

00:15:12.820 --> 00:15:14.390
Very well.

00:15:14.790 --> 00:15:19.710
Your pure feelings have touched me.

00:15:20.040 --> 00:15:26.340
I, Yama-Tengu, shall see to it that girl
doesn't return to the human world.

00:15:26.460 --> 00:15:30.150
Thank you very much, Yama-Tengu-sama!

00:15:31.090 --> 00:15:32.660
Now you see.

00:15:32.680 --> 00:15:37.060
You understand that you have to return to
the human world.

00:15:37.350 --> 00:15:39.480
Miyabi, are you leaving?

00:15:40.560 --> 00:15:42.400
Don't go, Miyabi.

00:15:42.520 --> 00:15:44.230
Play with us forever.

00:15:44.360 --> 00:15:46.070
I wish I could!

00:15:50.990 --> 00:15:52.740
Just like me!

00:16:00.620 --> 00:16:05.170
I'm sorry, but I have to go.

00:16:08.630 --> 00:16:11.360
Don't take Miyabi away!

00:16:11.880 --> 00:16:13.110
You guys...

00:16:13.390 --> 00:16:15.970
Miyabi loves this forest!

00:16:16.100 --> 00:16:19.620
Miyabi said she'd stay with us forever!

00:16:19.640 --> 00:16:24.120
If you're forcing her to go
then you've got another thing coming!

00:16:34.780 --> 00:16:36.430
YAMA-TENGU

00:16:36.450 --> 00:16:39.100
What's Yama-Tengu-san doing here?!

00:16:40.580 --> 00:16:42.960
We asked him to help us!

00:16:43.080 --> 00:16:44.630
Let her go!

00:16:44.790 --> 00:16:46.610
Don't hurt the children!

00:16:47.090 --> 00:16:48.460
How about that, Kitaro!

00:16:48.590 --> 00:16:50.460
Now go on home!

00:16:52.720 --> 00:16:54.450
How beautiful.

00:16:54.760 --> 00:16:56.300
I like this one!

00:16:56.430 --> 00:16:59.280
I shall claim this girl as my wife!

00:16:59.310 --> 00:17:00.720
Yama-Tengu-san?!

00:17:00.850 --> 00:17:02.940
That's not what you promised!

00:17:03.060 --> 00:17:09.780
I merely promised to help keep this girl
from returning to the human world!

00:17:09.900 --> 00:17:10.820
Wait!

00:17:18.240 --> 00:17:22.250
We did it because
we wanted to help Miyabi.

00:17:22.370 --> 00:17:25.140
We didn't know this would happen.

00:17:25.580 --> 00:17:32.050
Kinoko, happiness for a spirit
and for a human is not always the same.

00:17:32.170 --> 00:17:33.630
Try to understand.

00:17:33.760 --> 00:17:36.410
Will you let her go home?

00:17:39.100 --> 00:17:41.680
We want Miyabi to be happy!

00:17:41.810 --> 00:17:44.690
We want her to go to her human home.

00:17:44.810 --> 00:17:48.650
First we have to get her back from
Yama-Tengu-san.

00:17:50.270 --> 00:17:52.420
Thanks for understanding.

00:17:52.820 --> 00:17:58.550
Human girl, I shall care for you
for the rest of your life.

00:17:58.820 --> 00:18:00.660
Consider yourself blessed.

00:18:02.910 --> 00:18:07.120
But, should you ever try to run,

00:18:08.380 --> 00:18:12.800
I shall tear out your liver and eat you!

00:18:12.920 --> 00:18:15.690
Yama-Tengu-sama!

00:18:15.720 --> 00:18:21.050
We've brought lots of offerings
to celebrate your marriage!

00:18:21.180 --> 00:18:23.720
Please open your fortress gates!

00:18:23.850 --> 00:18:25.700
Please open up!

00:18:25.930 --> 00:18:28.730
Very well. Open!

00:18:30.730 --> 00:18:32.400
Come in.

00:18:36.820 --> 00:18:40.320
Little Kinoko, such an admirable gesture.

00:18:40.450 --> 00:18:44.660
Splendid, splendid! Quite splendid!

00:18:45.720 --> 00:18:46.790
Everyone!

00:18:46.910 --> 00:18:48.750
Fools!

00:18:48.870 --> 00:18:51.500
You're trying to get Miyabi back,

00:18:51.630 --> 00:18:55.920
so you hid Kitaro inside your offering!

00:18:56.050 --> 00:18:58.510
I already knew you would!

00:18:59.430 --> 00:19:00.680
Mud dumplings?

00:19:00.800 --> 00:19:03.330
Then where is Kitaro?

00:19:03.600 --> 00:19:05.490
I'm right here!

00:19:11.400 --> 00:19:12.770
Curse you!

00:19:12.900 --> 00:19:13.630
Miyabi!

00:19:13.820 --> 00:19:14.690
This way!

00:19:14.820 --> 00:19:15.860
Look after her!

00:19:16.150 --> 00:19:17.570
Kitaro!

00:19:18.070 --> 00:19:19.610
Nose Hair Needles!

00:19:20.030 --> 00:19:21.300
Hair Needles!

00:19:23.580 --> 00:19:25.370
This way, Yama-Tengu!

00:19:25.490 --> 00:19:26.560
Get back here!

00:19:26.830 --> 00:19:28.160
Hurry to the exit!

00:19:28.290 --> 00:19:29.060
Okay!

00:19:29.080 --> 00:19:30.580
Take this!

00:19:30.810 --> 00:19:34.800
Tengu Stones!

00:19:37.630 --> 00:19:39.220
Tengu Topple!

00:19:39.340 --> 00:19:40.430
What?!

00:19:49.690 --> 00:19:50.560
Everyone!

00:19:50.690 --> 00:19:52.480
We'll protect you, Miyabi!

00:19:52.600 --> 00:19:53.770
We'll protect!

00:19:53.900 --> 00:19:55.270
Thank you!

00:19:56.440 --> 00:19:59.070
As promised, I shall eat you!

00:19:59.190 --> 00:20:00.150
Stop!

00:20:01.660 --> 00:20:04.010
Kitaro? You insolent whelp!

00:20:04.010 --> 00:20:05.640
Nose Hair Needles!

00:20:05.660 --> 00:20:07.370
Remote Controlled Geta!

00:20:08.040 --> 00:20:09.330
Finger Guns!

00:20:22.510 --> 00:20:24.680
The path is closing soon.

00:20:24.800 --> 00:20:26.760
Take care, Miyabi.

00:20:26.890 --> 00:20:29.410
You take care, too. Thank you.

00:20:29.680 --> 00:20:33.440
If humans and spirits ever come to
live together,

00:20:33.560 --> 00:20:35.170
let's play again.

00:20:36.150 --> 00:20:37.420
I swear it.

00:20:37.610 --> 00:20:39.190
See you, Miyabi!

00:20:39.320 --> 00:20:41.840
See you, everyone! Bye-bye!

00:20:41.860 --> 00:20:43.340
Bye-bye!

00:20:43.990 --> 00:20:45.490
See you again!

00:20:45.620 --> 00:20:47.370
Bye-bye!

00:20:48.450 --> 00:20:50.500
Take care, everyone!

00:20:56.000 --> 00:20:59.090
It may have felt like a long time,

00:20:59.210 --> 00:21:04.380
but in this world, it's still the evening
of the day you left.

00:21:04.510 --> 00:21:06.470
Miyabi!

00:21:07.720 --> 00:21:08.950
Mana!

00:21:09.520 --> 00:21:10.850
Miyabi!

00:21:10.970 --> 00:21:12.020
Mana!

00:21:12.140 --> 00:21:13.520
We found you!

00:21:15.190 --> 00:21:18.270
I'm sorry. I'm late for our meeting!

00:21:18.400 --> 00:21:19.530
Dummy!

00:21:24.360 --> 00:21:25.490
Mom!

00:21:29.080 --> 00:21:33.580
Miyabi! Where have you been?

00:21:33.710 --> 00:21:37.080
In a dream world... I think?

00:21:37.210 --> 00:21:39.460
What are you talking about?

00:21:39.750 --> 00:21:43.260
Say, Mom, have you made dinner already?

00:21:43.380 --> 00:21:44.510
I'm about to start.

00:21:44.630 --> 00:21:46.010
Then I'll help!

00:21:46.130 --> 00:21:49.260
I won't always be a child, you know!

00:21:49.720 --> 00:21:51.270
Then let's make it together.

00:21:51.390 --> 00:21:52.520
Okay!

00:22:14.580 --> 00:22:17.750
<i>You're a dream
My dream</i>

00:22:14.580 --> 00:22:17.750
<i>kimi wa yume boku no yume</i>

00:22:17.880 --> 00:22:21.210
<i>I'm dreaming in a dream</i>

00:22:17.880 --> 00:22:21.210
<i>yume no naka de yume miteiru</i>

00:22:21.340 --> 00:22:24.720
<i>Let's stay like this forever</i>

00:22:21.340 --> 00:22:24.720
<i>itsumade mo kono mama de imashou</i>

00:22:25.130 --> 00:22:28.300
<i>You blur and begin to fade</i>

00:22:25.130 --> 00:22:28.300
<i>kasuka kimi ga nijimu</i>

00:22:28.430 --> 00:22:35.020
<i>Don't you cry
Where did you come from?</i>

00:22:28.430 --> 00:22:35.020
<i>Don't you cry anata wa doko kara kitano?</i>

00:22:35.140 --> 00:22:39.770
<i>A masquerade
Faceless faces laugh</i>

00:22:35.140 --> 00:22:39.770
<i>kamenbutou kao no nai kao ga warau</i>

00:22:39.900 --> 00:22:42.150
<i>Hee-hee-hee</i>

00:22:39.900 --> 00:22:42.150
<i>fufufu</i>

00:22:42.270 --> 00:22:45.820
<i>In dreams, in dreams
Lost in dreams</i>

00:22:42.270 --> 00:22:45.820
<i>yume ni yume ni yume ni samayoi</i>

00:22:45.940 --> 00:22:48.160
<i>Twirling around</i>

00:22:45.940 --> 00:22:48.160
<i>kuru kuru to mawaru</i>

00:22:48.280 --> 00:22:52.490
<i>Everyone dancing, dancing
Looking for love</i>

00:22:48.280 --> 00:22:52.490
<i>dare mo odoru odoru ai wo sagashite</i>

00:22:52.620 --> 00:22:59.330
<i>RONDO, spin, spin
Dream, dream</i>

00:22:52.620 --> 00:22:59.330
<i>RONDO mawareyo maware yume yume</i>

00:23:01.670 --> 00:23:05.710
<i>Dad... Humans and </i>yokai
<i>only think about themselves.</i>

00:23:05.840 --> 00:23:07.420
<i>Wait, that's...</i>

00:23:07.800 --> 00:23:09.550
<i>Next time on GeGeGe no Kitaro</i>

00:23:09.680 --> 00:23:12.930
<i>"Narcissism Overload!
Nuke-Kubi's Close Call"</i>

00:23:13.060 --> 00:23:15.600
<i>The door to the unseen world opens...</i>
